# Outbound Send bounce mail-back (avoid Docker hairpin to public :25).
# Use built-in smtp (TLS may → cleartext to backend:2525). No custom master.cf transport.
# See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-19-postfix-bounce-transport-design.md
/^b-[^@]+@hm-bounce\./i          smtp:[backend]:2525
/^b-[^@]+@rp\.hide-mail\.org$/i  smtp:[backend]:2525
